## Never cache the HTML entry point — ensures browsers always fetch the latest chunk manifest
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

## Hashed static assets can be cached forever (filename changes on every build)
/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

## Invitation-only admissions materials are shareable by URL but not indexable.
/admissions-materials/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Cache-Control: private, no-store
